---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageIntro from '../../components/PageIntro.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy">
  <PageIntro eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy Policy" />
  <section class="wrap legal-body"><aside><a class="back-link" href="/legal/">← Legal</a></aside><div class="prose">
    <h2>Contact and correspondence</h2>
    <p>For privacy questions or requests concerning your information, contact Glosso at <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>. If you email us, we use your address, message and attachments to respond and manage the correspondence. Email providers also process those messages. Retention depends on the purpose of the correspondence and the provider’s practices. You can request deletion at the same address.</p>
    <h2>Hosting and analytics</h2>
    <p>Cloudflare is our selected hosting and analytics provider. When it serves the site, it processes technical information, including IP addresses and requested URLs, for delivery, security and traffic analysis. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/policies/privacy/">Cloudflare’s privacy policy</a>.</p>
    <p>Cloudflare dashboard analytics summarize traffic. Cloudflare Web Analytics, when enabled, measures visits and performance without analytics cookies or local storage. See our <a href="/legal/cookies/">Cookie Policy</a> for the distinction between analytics and security cookies.</p>
    <h2>Other websites</h2>
    <p>External links and externally hosted media are subject to their providers’ privacy practices.</p>
    <h2>Updates</h2>
    <p>We will update this policy when our data practices change.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
